---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MPDC CRM | Changelog</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/crm/styles.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* Reusing CRM Styles */
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; }
        .app-container { display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
        .sidebar { width: 240px; background: #1e293b; border-right: 1px solid #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 20px; }
        .logo-container { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 0 12px; }
        .logo-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #8b5cf6); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; color: white; }
        .logo-text { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .logo-text span { color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 400; }
        .nav-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .nav-item:hover, .nav-item.active { background: #334155; color: white; }
        .nav-item i { width: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .main-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 32px; background: #0f172a; }
        
        /* Changelog Specific Styles */
        .changelog-card {
            background: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .cl-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
            padding-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .cl-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
        .cl-date { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; }
        
        .code-audit-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .audit-item {
            background: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .audit-label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .audit-value { font-size: 14px; color: #e2e8f0; font-family: monospace; background: #1e293b; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; }
        .audit-status { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 8px; }
        .status-active { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #10b981; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }

        .log-entry {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .log-entry::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 14px;
            top: 32px;
            bottom: -24px;
            width: 2px;
            background: #334155;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .log-entry:last-child::before { display: none; }
        
        .log-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #3b82f6;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            z-index: 1;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border: 4px solid #1e293b;
        }
        .log-content {
            flex: 1;
            background: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .log-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; }
        .log-desc { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .log-files { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #334155; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; font-family: monospace; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="app-container">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <div class="logo-icon">M</div>
                <h1 class="logo-text">MPDC<span>CRM</span></h1>
            </div>

            <nav class="main-nav">
                <a href="/crm" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-grid-2"></i>
                    <span>Dashboard</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/analytics" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i>
                    <span>Analytics</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/strategy" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chess"></i>
                    <span>Strategy</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/changelog" class="nav-item active">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i>
                    <span>Changelog</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/backups" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i>
                    <span>Backup Log</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/clients" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                    <span>Clients</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/leads" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>
                    <span>Leads</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/prospects" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i>
                    <span>IG Prospects</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                    <span>Deals</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
                    <span>Inbox</span>
                    <span class="badge">3</span>
                </a>
                <div class="pt-4 pb-2 text-xs font-bold text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest px-4" style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px;">Marketing</div>
                <a href="/crm/seo" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-search"></i>
                    <span>SEO Manager</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/schema" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i>
                    <span>Schema Injector</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/crm/cro" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column"></i>
                    <span>CRO Analysis</span>
                </a>
            </nav>

            <div class="secondary-nav" style="margin-top:auto">
                <a href="#" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gear"></i>
                    <span>Settings</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="nav-item">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question"></i>
                    <span>Help Center</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="user-profile">
                <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Greg+Montoya&background=3b82f6&color=fff" alt="User" class="avatar">
                <div class="user-info">
                    <p class="user-name">Greg Montoya</p>
                    <p class="user-role">Admin</p>
                </div>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="main-content">
            <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">System Changelog</h1>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 32px;">Track all code deployments, integration statuses, and system updates.</p>

            <!-- Active Integrations Audit -->
            <div class="changelog-card">
                <div class="cl-header">
                    <div class="cl-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check" style="color: #10b981; margin-right: 10px;"></i> Active Codebase Audit</div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-audit-grid">
                    <div class="audit-item">
                        <div class="audit-label">Google Analytics 4</div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="audit-value">G-T26PKTMJB1</span>
                            <span class="audit-status status-active">Active</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 6px;">Location: Global Layout (Head)</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="audit-item">
                        <div class="audit-label">Stripe Payments</div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="audit-value">pk_live_...</span>
                            <span class="audit-status status-active">Active</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 6px;">Logic: Cloud Functions + Elements</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="audit-item">
                        <div class="audit-label">Google Fonts</div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="audit-value">Montserrat / Open Sans / Bebas</span>
                            <span class="audit-status status-active">Active</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                     <div class="audit-item">
                        <div class="audit-label">Firebase Functions</div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="audit-value">Node.js 18</span>
                            <span class="audit-status status-active">Active</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 6px;">Events: stripeWebhook, createCheckoutSession</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Changelog Feed -->
            <div class="changelog-feed">
                
                <div class="log-entry">
                    <div class="log-icon" style="background: #3b82f6;"><i class="fa-solid fa-crosshairs"></i></div>
                    <div class="log-content">
                        <div class="log-meta">
                            <span><strong>v2.0.5</strong></span>
                            <span>{new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-desc">
                            <strong>Professional Attribution System (Hyros-Lite)</strong><br>
                            Implemented server-side tracking to identify exactly where sales are coming from.
                            <ul style="margin-top: 8px; list-style: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                                <li><strong>UTM Capture:</strong> Tracks Source, Medium, Campaign from first click.</li>
                                <li><strong>Stripe Integration:</strong> Passes marketing data into every transaction metadata.</li>
                                <li><strong>Slack Alerts:</strong> Now displays "Source: Instagram" directly in notifications.</li>
                                <li><strong>Smart Logic:</strong> Persists data for 30 days via LocalStorage.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-files">
                            New: public/js/global-attribution.js | Modified: webhook-server/index.js, src/pages/join/index.astro
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="log-entry">
                    <div class="log-icon" style="background: #10b981;"><i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i></div>
                    <div class="log-content">
                        <div class="log-meta">
                            <span><strong>v2.0.4</strong></span>
                            <span>{new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-desc">
                            <strong>Robust Notifications & Slack Integration</strong><br>
                            Compete overhaul of the sales notification system to ensure 100% reliability.
                            <ul style="margin-top: 8px; list-style: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                                <li><strong>Slack Alerts:</strong> Real-time sales notifications sent to #sales channel.</li>
                                <li><strong>Fail-Safe Logic:</strong> Isolated error handling for Emails vs. Slack vs. Admin alerts.</li>
                                <li><strong>Fix:</strong> Resolved Vercel environment variable issue causing missing emails.</li>
                                <li><strong>Safety Check:</strong> Automated pre-deploy integrity verification passed.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-files">
                            Modified: webhook-server/index.js, CHANGELOG.md, package.json
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="log-entry">
                    <div class="log-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i></div>
                    <div class="log-content">
                        <div class="log-meta">
                            <span><strong>Deployment #789</strong></span>
                            <span>Today, 21:32 PM</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-desc">
                            <strong>Restored Live Site Clone & Created Dev Environment</strong><br>
                            Successfully cloned the Home Page, Join Page, and Checkout Logic from the live production site to the new Staging environment.
                            <ul>
                                <li>Restored "The System" 5-step syllabus UI.</li>
                                <li>Restored "About" and "Community" sections on Home.</li>
                                <li><strong>Fixed Checkout:</strong> Replaced static test link with dynamic API call to <code>/api/create-checkout-session</code>.</li>
                                <li>Added Global Promo Banner (50% OFF).</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-files">
                            Modified: src/pages/index.astro, src/components/Header.astro, public/join/main.js
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                 <div class="log-entry">
                    <div class="log-icon" style="background: #ef4444;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bug"></i></div>
                    <div class="log-content">
                        <div class="log-meta">
                            <span><strong>Fix #726</strong></span>
                            <span>Today, 20:15 PM</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="log-desc">
                            <strong>Fixed Blog Post Compiler Error</strong><br>
                            Resolved an Astro compiler error in <code>BlogPost.astro</code> where imports were placed outside the frontmatter fence.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
